<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy | Web Binary</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Poppins:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4A6FFF; --background: #F9FAFB; --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
            --text-dark: #2D3748; --text-light: #718096; --border: #E2E8F0;
            --radius: 12px; --shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #4A6FFF 0%, #00D4AA 100%);
        }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--background); color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .policy-container { max-width: 900px; margin: 80px auto; padding: 40px; background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
        h1 { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; background: var(--gradient); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        h2 { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; color: var(--primary); margin-top: 30px; }
        .last-updated { color: var(--text-light); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="policy-container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: October 2023</p>
        <section>
            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>At Web Binary, we collect personal information that you provide to us, such as name, email address, and contact details when you register on our network.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
            <p>Your data is used to provide social features, business updates, and to improve our global network experience.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>